nting**: Melodies that build slowly, creating an otherworldly atmosphere.\n3. **Dramatic and Epic**: Grand orchestral pieces that highlight the majestic scale of the floating island and its unique features.\n4. **Nature-Inspired**: Tracks using elements like strings, woodwinds, and gentle piano, reflecting the harmony between nature and civilization.\n\n### Example Soundtrack:\n- **Opening Scene**: Ambient and atmospheric music with soft winds and gentle waterfalls.\n- **Floating Island Exploration**: Mystical and enchanting music as the camera pans across the cityscape and lush landscapes.\n- **Lava Flow Discovery**: Dramatic and epic music as the viewer discovers the fiery lava cascades down the cliffside.\n- **Conclusion**: Nature-inspired music that ties everything together, emphasizing the balance between the natural world and human creation.\n\nThis combination of sound effects and music will help immerse viewers into the fantastical world depicted in the video, enhancing their overall experience."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 210, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 109, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "2c09d59ab5ac27ac59022832bfde4eeeb9c55825", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [212], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [418.2532653808594, 294.00335693359375], "pos": [2999.65087890625, 567.4976806640625], "widgets_values": ["", "To create a compelling video, consider the following sound effects and background music:\n\n### Sound Effects:\n1. **Knocking Sound**: When the knife makes contact with the sphere, include a distinct knocking or tapping sound to emphasize the impact.\n2. **Slicing Sound**: As the knife cuts through the sphere, incorporate a smooth slicing sound that reflects the action without being too loud or jarring.\n3. **Cracking Noise**: If the sphere cracks upon cutting, add a subtle cracking noise to enhance the visual effect.\n4. **Hand Movement**: Soft, deliberate hand movements as they handle the sphere can be included to provide context.\n\n### Background Music:\n1. **Mellow Instrumental**: A calm, instrumental piece with soft piano or guitar melodies can set a serene tone for the video.\n2. **Ambient Sounds**: Ambient sounds like gentle rain or a distant choir can create an immersive atmosphere.\n3. **Subtle Percussion**: Light percussion such as light drums or cymbals can add depth without overpowering the visuals.\n\n### Example Soundtrack:\n- **Opening Scene**: Start with a soft ambient track to build anticipation.\n- **Impact Moment**: Use the knocking sound when the knife first touches the sphere.\n- **Cutting Phase**: Incorporate the slicing sound as the blade progresses through the sphere.\n- **Conclusion**: Return to the ambient or mellow instrumental for a smooth conclusion.\n\nThis combination of sound effects and background music will enhance the viewer's experience by complementing the visual elements effectively."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 211, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 129, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "2c09d59ab5ac27ac59022832bfde4eeeb9c55825", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [211], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 372], "pos": [2635.295654296875, 125.96232604980469], "widgets_values": ["Summary video content，Suggest me suitable sound effects for every object and background, additional suitable background music", "MiniCPM-V-2_6-in